---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="AffiliateBharat ki privacy policy — hum kaunsa data collect karte hain (aur kya nahi), cookies, analytics aur affiliate links ke baare me."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Chhoti site, chhoti policy — jo collect karte hain wahi likha hai.</p>
    <p><em>Last updated: 18 October 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Hum kya collect NAHI karte</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Is site par <strong>koi account, login ya signup nahi</strong> hai — hum aapka naam, email ya phone number kabhi nahi maangte.</li>
      <li>Hum forms ke through koi personal data store nahi karte.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Hum <strong>Google Analytics</strong> use karte hain taaki samajh sakein kaunse articles padhe ja rahe hain.
      Ye anonymous usage statistics collect karta hai (jaise kaunse pages visit hue, kaunsa device/browser).
      Google is data ko apni <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a> ke
      hisaab se handle karta hai. Agar aap tracking nahi chahte, to browser me "Do Not Track" on kar sakte hain
      ya Google ka <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">opt-out add-on</a> install kar sakte hain.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Google Analytics apne cookies set karta hai taaki repeat visits pehchane ja sakein.
      Hum khud koi advertising ya tracking cookies set nahi karte.
      Aap browser settings se cookies kabhi bhi delete ya block kar sakte hain — site bina cookies ke bhi chalegi.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links aur third-party sites</h2>
    <p>
      Jab aap hamare affiliate link par click karke kisi merchant site (jaise hosting company ya Flipkart/Amazon)
      par jate hain, to wahan <strong>unki privacy policy</strong> lagti hai, hamari nahi.
      Un sites par aap jo data dete hain, uske liye hum zimmedar nahi hain.
    </p>

    <h2>Bachchon ki privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Ye site bachchon ke liye specifically designed nahi hai, aur hum jaan-boojhkar 13 saal se kam
      umar ke bachchon ka data collect nahi karte (karte hi nahi, to sawaal hi nahi uthta).
    </p>

    <h2>Policy me badlaav</h2>
    <p>
      Agar ye policy kabhi badlegi, to updated date ke saath yahin publish hogi.
    </p>

    <h2>Sampark</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy se juda koi sawal ho to:
      <a href="mailto:hello@affiliatebharat.com">hello@affiliatebharat.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page h2 { margin: 2.2rem 0 0.8rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .page p, .page li { font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .page ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .page li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
</style>
